r":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-26T15:45:07Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T15:45:07Z","body":"> The way this extends the context menu horizontally is very, very nasty in my opinion. It's very unfortunate.\r\n\r\nSo it needs a name shorter than `Instantiate Child Scene...`, which is... challenging.\r\n\r\nBut I have high hopes for the usability team to come up with a shorter name! You can do this!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5427631606/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5538279709","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122466#issuecomment-5538279709","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122466","id":5538279709,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABShtxHQ","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-04T09:12:21Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T09:12:21Z","body":"Considering https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123145, would it be better to instead have one shortcut for `Show in FileSystem` {current scene} and another shortcut for `Show in FileSystem` {external scene}?\r\n\r\nIMO the `Show in FileSystem` shortcuts would be more useful if they work on child nodes as well.\r\n\r\nIt also feels weird that `Show in FileSystem` works for the current scene and instantiated scenes, while `Show in FileSystem (parent)` only works for inherited scenes... it feels more natural to group showing instantiated & inherited scenes together.\r\n\r\nIn that case, the context menu buttons could be named `Show Current Scene` and `Show External Scene` instead, which are both shorter than `Instantiate Child Scene...`.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, a cleaner way is to remove `Show in FileSystem` {current scene} from the root node to free up the existing name & shortcut for `Show in FileSystem` {inherited scene}. This might be controversial, however.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5538279709/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]